  <h2 data-rte-preserve-empty="true" id="yui_3_17_2_1_1779491707314_18499">A Simple Monthly Email Calendar for Service Providers</h2><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">If you are not sure where to start, here is a basic monthly structure that works well:</p><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Week one: An educational email sharing a tip, insight, or practical framework related to your area of expertise.</p></li><li><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Week two: A story email, something personal or behind the scenes that builds connection.</p></li><li><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Week three: A social proof email featuring a client win, testimonial, or case study.</p></li><li><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">Week four: An offer email with a clear call to action to book, inquire, or learn more about working with you.</p></li></ul><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">This rotation keeps your content varied, your relationships warm, and your business top of mind without requiring you to reinvent your strategy every month.</p><h2 data-rte-preserve-empty="true">What Platform Should You Use?</h2><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">For service providers, we recommend <a target="_blank" href="https://flodesk.com/c/MBXWYG"><strong>Flodesk</strong></a> for its beautiful, on-brand templates and simple flat rate pricing that does not penalize you for growing your list (PS: you can lock in <strong>25% off your first year</strong> by clicking <span data-text-attribute-id="49759f57-7442-41b8-b1b7-936419db9677" class="sqsrte-text-highlight"><a target="_blank" href="https://flodesk.com/c/MBXWYG">here</a></span>!). If you are already on <strong>Squarespace</strong>, their built-in email tool integrates cleanly and is a solid option for getting started without adding another platform. </p><p data-rte-preserve-empty="true" class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]">At CL Studio, we work with service-based small business owners across Nashville and nationwide, and email is one of the first things we talk about because it is so consistently underused. Most service providers are sitting on a warm audience that is ready to hear from them. They just need to start showing up.</p>


  









